<view class="u2-page">
  <view class="u2-kicker">读动态，也看出处</view>
  <view class="u2-h1 news-title">校园正发生。</view>
  <view class="u2-lead">来自学校公开来源，由云函数同步；列表保留真实来源、发布日期与同步时间。</view>

  <view class="news-source-line">
    <text class="news-source-label">来源：{{source.label}}</text>
    <text wx:if="{{syncedAtText !== ''}}" class="news-source-time">最近写入 {{syncedAtText}}</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{status === 'loading'}}" id="news-loading" class="u2-card u2-card-line news-state">
    <view class="u2-card-title">正在读取</view>
    <view class="u2-card-copy">正在从云端读取校园资讯…</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{status === 'error'}}" id="news-error" class="u2-notice u2-notice-error news-state">
    <view class="u2-notice-title">暂时读不到内容</view>
    <view class="news-state-copy">{{errorMessage}}</view>
    <button id="retry-load" class="u2-btn u2-btn-secondary news-state-button" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="retry">重试</button>
    <button id="back-home" class="u2-btn u2-btn-secondary news-state-button" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="goHome">返回首页</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{status === 'empty'}}" id="news-empty" class="u2-card u2-card-line news-state">
    <view class="u2-card-title">暂无资讯</view>
    <view class="u2-card-copy">云端还没有已同步的条目，同步成功后文章会出现在这里。</view>
    <button id="back-home" class="u2-btn u2-btn-secondary news-state-button" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="goHome">返回首页</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="news-list">
    <view
      wx:for="{{rows}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="news-row"
      hover-class="pressed"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="openDetail"
    >
      <view class="news-date">
        <text class="news-date-day">{{item.day}}</text>
        <text class="news-date-month">{{item.month}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="news-row-main">
        <view class="news-row-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="news-row-meta">{{item.date === '' ? '日期待核实' : item.date}} · 来自学校官网</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{moreState === 'loading'}}" class="news-more">正在加载更早的资讯…</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{moreState === 'error'}}" id="news-more-error" class="news-more news-more-error">
      <view class="news-more-copy">{{errorMessage}}</view>
      <button id="retry-more" class="u2-btn u2-btn-secondary news-more-button" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="retryMore">重试</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{hasMore}}" id="news-more-tap" class="news-more news-more-tap" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="loadMore">上滑或点此加载更多</view>
    <view wx:else class="news-more">已经到底了</view>

    <view class="u2-actions">
      <button id="back-home" class="u2-btn u2-btn-secondary" hover-class="pressed" bindtap="goHome">返回首页</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="u2-source">
    <view class="u2-source-line">内容由云函数从官网同步，不是实时更新，也不代表整批同步都成功。</view>
    <view class="u2-source-line">详情页为小程序自身页面，可复制原文链接到浏览器核对。</view>
  </view>
</view>